se we had something, we wanted to fix and update, so here it is.At first we focused on physics and graphics optimization. Also there were some problems with hoomans stucking, so fixed that too.Fixed fabrics, now they all work as intend","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:53:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684304","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3979370-1846018067924660","game_id":"steam-3979370","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo released!","summary":"Hey everyone! Glad to see you here!On the 2nd of October we released our Demo, just as planned. The first build was pretty unstable, but we fixed everything related to critical issues, like connection problems. Now everything should work like a charm.So, what's new in demo.Hub. Now you can chill with your buddies between missionsSlot machine. You know...Ranks. That's easy - do missions, get promotions, open new maps and equipmentCosmetics. Spend your hard earned money in the shop on Beards and H","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T00:40:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924660","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3979370-1835236783568531","game_id":"steam-3979370","kind":"announcement","title":"Untitled","summary":"2 weeks of playtest passed very quickly! More than 3000 players!Thanks to all participants, to those who made reports and sent their feedback!We got a grasp on what you wanted and what you needed and based on that we came up with a roadmap for the Demo that we plan couple of months later.Money. You earned them, but couldn't spend them.Repetative House. More interactions with hoomanMore interactive objects and items in the worldProgressionIt was good to hear all of that because now we have a grea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-14T20:55:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783568531","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3979370-1833334318580111","game_id":"steam-3979370","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest is LIVE!","summary":"We have launched our playtest!And 1370 of you signed up for it! Huge achievement for us! For the past month we were fixing critical bugs and major problems so we could release a playable version of the game.Though, i believe, You will find a lot more than we could and we will be grateful for that! You can send you suggestions and findings from inside the game or in our DiscordOkay, back to playtest. Right now the game has it's main mechanics and game loop - Loot&Go, if you wish. We want to under","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T18:27:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318580111","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3979370-1832700592789166","game_id":"steam-3979370","kind":"update","title":"Playtest news update","summary":"Dear community! We are deeply sorry for not posting news, we got troubles with fixing crucial problems with our build, so you can have pleasant experience with the content that we have right now.I believe that we are somewhere near finishing fixes and polishing, and the playtest will come out somewhere in a week.Again, we apologize for the unexpected delay and are doing everything possible to finish it as soon as we can!P.S. More than 1200 people want to participate!Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T14:02:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592789166","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3979370-1828894815563605","game_id":"steam-3979370","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest news","summary":"Hey everyone!Thanks for lots of attention to our game. I'm happy to announce that there are 700 playtesters ready to deploy!It's an enormous number, as i see it, so it's really cool. Also, for each playtester we give 3 invites for friends!The playtest will be held in the 20th of April, so, in about two weeks. We want to polish last things, so you can test it out.I'm also thinking about some sort of feedback channel, but don't know exactly what it will actually be.But stay tuned, i'll contact you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-05T12:57:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815563605","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:15:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3979370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3979370":"2026-10-26T11:21:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3979370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:24Z"},"5112550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:24Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3979370","app_id":3979370,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:26Z","source_url":"https://api.steampower